# SO-101 run sheet. E124: Cover the camera.
# Run from the root of this checkout, against the arm registered as arm-01:
#   quackd run docs/examples/lerobot/e124/cover-the-camera.duck --robot arm-01 --camera-url "opencv://1?name=front" --llm openai:gpt-6-sol --max-steps 10 --no-memory
---
duck: 1
name: e124-cover-the-camera
description: "Describe three changes in the scene."
author: rok
requires: [report_state]
verbs:
  allow: [report_state, move_joints, gripper, place, stop]
  confirm: []
budgets:
  max_steps: 10
  max_minutes: 5
  max_llm_calls: 24
success:
  - "You have done what the task asks, as best you can tell from your joints and any camera pictures, or said plainly why this body cannot."
abort_when:
  - Same verb fails 3 times in a row
persona: "Practical and honest: say so when you cannot do something."
---

# Task

Watch the camera and describe any change in the scene, one fresh look per turn with `report_state`. Continue until you have described three changes.
